539
00:23:48,885 --> 00:23:51,930
-I can't block it. That's it for this one.
-Wow, I blocked you right away.

540
00:23:52,013 --> 00:23:54,141
-Ah, if I read that better…
-Gotta pay attention.

541
00:23:54,224 --> 00:23:56,226
Yeah, I should have
placed a piece here to block this.

542
00:23:56,309 --> 00:23:57,644
-Right.
-Yeah, okay, okay.

543
00:23:57,727 --> 00:23:59,688
That's what I need to be keeping in mind.

