-You take black.

908
00:43:19,305 --> 00:43:20,639
Hyun Kyung-lyul for black.

909
00:43:20,723 --> 00:43:22,725
Jang Dong-min for white.
I'll flip the coin.

910
00:43:25,060 --> 00:43:27,855
White. Jang Dong-min,
the first move is yours.

911
00:43:28,522 --> 00:43:30,858
Here is the board for round one.

912
00:43:30,941 --> 00:43:32,192
All right…

913
00:43:35,029 --> 00:43:37,156
Oh, those are already on the board.

914
00:43:37,239 --> 00:43:38,949
Yeah, they got an X and a Y on there.

915
00:43:39,033 --> 00:43:41,452
-So those two need to be connected?
-That's correct.

916
00:43:42,077 --> 00:43:46,123
Jang Dong-min, you have three minutes
to place one piece, starting now.

917
00:44:02,014 --> 00:44:04,099
Hyun Kyung-lyul, it is now your turn.

918
00:44:04,183 --> 00:44:06,101
You have three minutes
to place two pieces.

919
00:44:06,769 --> 00:44:08,270
As soon as the board came up,

920
00:44:08,354 --> 00:44:11,398
I could see how the pairs of X's and Y's
are in, like, a cross shape.

921
00:44:11,482 --> 00:44:13,817
Apart from the edges of the board,
I can already tell

922
00:44:13,901 --> 00:44:16,862
