the first violation falls on.

948
00:45:42,781 --> 00:45:45,242
Yeah, like, if you think it could happen
on your opponent's turn,

949
00:45:45,325 --> 00:45:47,703
you place two pieces
you already know work,

950
00:45:47,786 --> 00:45:49,496
-and pass the turn to them.
-Oh.

951
00:45:49,997 --> 00:45:52,708
So if you run through it in your head,
you know exactly where to place them.

952
00:45:52,791 --> 00:45:56,003
-You lay down two letters that'll work.
-And you get past your opponent's turn

953
00:45:56,086 --> 00:45:57,463
-without them declaring.
-That's smart.

954
00:45:57,546 --> 00:45:59,131
It's a real battle of wits.

955
00:45:59,214 --> 00:46:00,924
-Definitely.
-Damn right it is.

956
00:46:04,762 --> 00:46:08,015
Hyun Kyung-lyul, it's your turn.
Please place two pieces.

957
00:46:20,569 --> 00:46:23,906
