-But what about the D's?

963
00:47:12,830 --> 00:47:14,206
One minute remains.

964
00:47:25,509 --> 00:47:28,929
Hyun Kyung-lyul, it's your turn.
Please place two pieces.

965
00:47:54,246 --> 00:47:55,497
I declare impossibility.

966
00:47:55,998 --> 00:47:58,625
Hyun Kyung-lyul has
declared impossibility.

967
00:47:58,709 --> 00:48:01,086
