placed the other D.

992
00:49:42,312 --> 00:49:44,314
Wow, that A placement was genius.

993
00:49:44,398 --> 00:49:46,692
Yeah, Kyung-lyul might've won it all
with that one move.

994
00:49:46,775 --> 00:49:50,195
By blocking the outer rim with the A's,
