1112
00:56:51,241 --> 00:56:54,119
-Yeah, this hurts my head.
-The X's are on opposite ends.

1113
00:56:54,202 --> 00:56:56,496
The path would go, like… …to the end.

1114
00:56:56,579 --> 00:56:58,957
Hyun Kyung-lyul, you have three minutes

1115
00:56:59,040 --> 00:57:01,501
to choose whether
to be the first or second player.

1116
00:57:02,001 --> 00:57:03,420
I'll go second this time.

1117
00:57:03,503 --> 00:57:05,463
Hyun Kyung-lyul has chosen to go second.

1118
00:57:05,547 --> 00:57:07,340
Since the X's are on opposite ends,

1119
00:57:07,424 --> 00:57:10,176
I'm thinking, with the second player
