how that diagonal path goes.

1121
00:57:13,179 --> 00:57:14,722
That's why I choose to go second.

1122
00:57:14,806 --> 00:57:17,225
Jang Dong-min, the first move is yours.

1123
00:57:17,308 --> 00:57:20,895
Starting now, you have three minutes
to place one piece on the board.

1124
00:57:25,150 --> 00:57:26,526
